    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1702314023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/7f6652181dd45b89f230dd1fa87d67b5.webp?t=1702314023\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/cdf7c3037893aae991ff78e735428629.poster.avif?t=1702314023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/cdf7c3037893aae991ff78e735428629.webm?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/cdf7c3037893aae991ff78e735428629.mp4?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pizza Empire is the best Pizza game ever!</strong></h2> Prepare, cook and serve a tasty pizza like only the best pizzaiolos can, explore the world and go where no pizzaiolo has gone before!<br><br>Bake pizza in the City, grill sausage and skewers in a Medieval village, serve fish and octopus in the Pirate Ship!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/3eeb3166b317358becef144b39186cb6.poster.avif?t=1702314023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/3eeb3166b317358becef144b39186cb6.webm?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/3eeb3166b317358becef144b39186cb6.mp4?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Will you accept the challenge?</strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/c081393b63a747f1b3e2ab250a6d9b46.webp?t=1702314023\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy time-management gameplay anytime!<br></li><li>Build your pizza empire in this Restaurant Game!<br></li><li>500+ Levels with Unique Goals<br></li><li>Cook up rewarding combos, earning big bonuses!</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/af94c6a73786d175bd9705d886851be9.poster.avif?t=1702314023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/af94c6a73786d175bd9705d886851be9.webm?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/af94c6a73786d175bd9705d886851be9.mp4?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/86b371a44ea4d03b6968d77eaba875c6.webp?t=1702314023\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use special boosts to cook your way to the glory<br></li><li>Upgrade your pizzeria and increase your speed<br></li><li>Challenge your friends and people around the world</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/f106c092aa1e7f5b3f52128f9aa4a8d7.poster.avif?t=1702314023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/f106c092aa1e7f5b3f52128f9aa4a8d7.webm?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/f106c092aa1e7f5b3f52128f9aa4a8d7.mp4?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/1a20fc1054320ac29de2bd688bab3738.webp?t=1702314023\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New levels and pizzerias around the world added regularly<br></li><li>Festivals and Seasons full of prizes only for you<br></li><li>Hours of free fun</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1702314023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690320/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1702314023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
